        "text_W4YYQp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Experience the pinnacle of Ayurvedic healing, cleansing, and rejuvenation at our first-ever Panchakarma Spring Retreat in India.<br/><br/></strong>The Natural Law’s Panchakarma Spring Retreat is a life-changing immersion in total wellness, taking place in the idyllic Sahyadri mountains of Pune, India.</p><p>Through seven days of treatments for the mind, body, and soul, you’re healed, cleansed, and rejuvenated with the greatest Ayurvedic treatments, under the loving guidance of master practitioners dedicated to their craft.</p><p>An intimate experience for just 20 participants, this retreat is a deeply personal journey that will cleanse you of all physical, emotional, and spiritual toxins, in the time of the year most aligned with growth and rejuvenation.</p><p>By the end of your journey, you will have ascended to the highest possible levels of wellness, balance, bliss, and youthful vitality - and leave with a newfound radiance that stays with you for life.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_WwyKKQ",
        "text_W4YYQp"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "align_text": "center",
        "narrow_column": false,
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false
      }
    },
    "columns_2_9Pb8KV": {
      "type": "columns-2",
      "blocks": {
        "text_QcQweU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><em><strong>Panchakarma is the greatest of all Ayurvedic treatments for cleansing, revitalization, and holistic wellbeing…And it’s now widely recognized as the answer to what’s missing in our modern approach to detoxification.</strong></em></p><p>The average commercial detox protocol can only promise short-term results that vanish within weeks or days – whereas Panchakarma delivers a lasting rejuvenation of the body’s detoxification systems:</p><p>The same ones so often disrupted by the modern lifestyle. Environmental pollutants. Medications and medical treatments. And even food pumped with the same pesticides used for combat in World War 2.</p><p>Panchakarma cleanses your body, mind, and soul through a series of professionally administered treatments delivered over the course of a week or less.</p><p><strong>The Panchakarma method has been perfected over 5,000 years – and its benefits are now finally recognized by modern science.</strong></p><p>A wealth of clinical studies highlight Panchakarma’s rapid toxin removal, inflammation reduction, anti-aging effects, and benefits in managing chronic diseases.</p><p>Every Panchakarma is personalized to its recipient’s unique needs. And even just one annual treatment can leave a profound impact on your health, wellness, and energy levels, all through the year.</p>"
          }
        },
