        "ece66265-849f-4144-a570-dd9d83ba0e5f": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Explore the Ayurveda Wellness Retreat Agenda",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 0: Arrival & Welcome Session",
            "text": "<p>On the day of your arrival, you’ll check into your accommodation, get familiar with your exquisite surroundings, and receive a welcome session with Amish. You’ll also be treated to a delicious Ayurvedic dinner, as you connect with your practitioners and your fellow participants.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Settle in and get comfortable</li><li>Harmonize with nature and your environment</li><li>Connect with the team and your fellow participants</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Relaxation",
            "text": "<p>Your journey begins with a bouquet of ancient treatments that carry your mind, body, and soul into the most profound depths of relaxation. From soothing oil massages, to refreshing steam muscle treatments, to natural remedies that refresh the eyes and skin, you’ll experience pure bliss and stillness that stays with you throughout your retreat.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Gain complete freedom from stress and anxiety</li><li>Embody bliss as your default state</li><li>Become fully present for your retreat</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "af9886df-0842-456c-a4da-f86a8fae9128": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Rejuvenation",
            "text": "<p>Your plunge into absolute relaxation continues on your second day, with ancient treatments like Shirodhara for a still mind and the Padabhyanga foot massage for rejuvenation and revitalization. Any lingering sense of fatigue will swiftly leave you, making way for boundless energy, focus, and clarity.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Replace fatigue and tiredness with radiant energy</li><li>Achieve total clarity of mind and thought</li><li>Experience true and unconditional stillness</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Detoxification",
            "text": "<p>The Panchakarma’s core goal of detoxification begins on your third day, with a series of Ayurvedic treatments for holistic cleansing and purification. Treatments like the Laghu Shankha Prakshalana, the Patra Potli, and the Ayurvedic mud bath will instantly and thoroughly cleanse you of accumulated toxins in every aspect of your being.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Eliminate accumulated toxins from the source</li><li>Cleanse your skin and other organs, returning them to optimal function</li><li>Achieve total purity through gentle yet invigorating exercises</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Holistic Healing",
            "text": "<p>Therapeutic oil massages, plant leaf baths, herbal eye remedies for better vision, and other blissful treatments await you on your fourth day, as you transition from detoxification to deep and holistic healing. By focusing on healing specific organs, you’ll be empowered to elevate your quality of life and bring greater joy, energy, and impact to every new day.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Heal and optimize your key markers of health and wellbeing</li><li>Correct imbalances in your organs and bodily functions</li><li>Gain protection from future health challenges</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: Integrated Wellness",
            "text": "<p>On your fifth day, you’ll be immersed in a combination of time-tested Ayurvedic treatments like Nasyam and Shashtik Shali Pinda Swedan, as well as modern treatments like Hydrotherapy that are carefully selected to amplify your positive outcomes. This is where ancient and modern science converge for your greatest good.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Heal, cleanse, and relax, all at the same time</li><li>Continue optimizing bodily functions, including your sinuses and respiratory health</li><li>Experience advanced modalities that enhance overall wellness</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: Ayurvedic Purification",
            "text": "<p>The penultimate day of your retreat takes you further into Ayurveda’s greatest purification protocols. In addition to further calming Shirodhara and Padabhyanga sessions, you’ll be guided through the Basti protocol for deep detoxification, leaving you completely cleansed and rejuvenated.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Enjoy a profound sense of relaxation and well-being</li><li>Expand your detoxification protocols</li><li>Expel any remaining toxins from your body, mind, and soul</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Final Detox & Excursion",
            "text": "<p>Before saying goodbye, you’ll indulge in one more day of relaxation and cleansing, including a therapeutic oil massage that soothes every fiber of your being. You’ll also discover simple ways to stay cleansed all year round, and embark on a tour of the nearby temples and market for a taste of local culture.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><em><strong>On this day you will:</strong></em></p><ul><li>Complete your detoxification experience</li><li>Integrate Ayurvedic detoxification and wellness into your daily life</li><li>Experience traditional Indian culture through a visit to local temples and markets</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "fe9d9b01-84d8-42dd-aa2f-b13bfa9cb5a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Departure",
            "text": "<p>You can breathe easy on your day of departure - your transport to the airport is fully covered, so you’re free to focus on your farewells and your reflections.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
