    "text_and_image_JPgmwm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DO-TNL-Amish-Headshot.png",
        "image_mask": "none",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Hosted by The Natural Law Founder Amish Shah & Team",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Amish Shah is a natural wellness advocate, an Inc. 500-listed entrepreneur, and a philanthropist with a 20-year career in the fields of health, wellness, and spirituality. </p><p>After Ayurvedic treatments healed him of a long list of life-threatening illnesses, Amish has dedicated his career and his life to spreading nature’s wisdom – first through his multiple award-winning film <em>The Natural Law</em> (now streaming on Amazon Prime), and then through online events, courses, and now retreats.</p><p><em>In addition to hosting the Panchakarma Spring Retreat, Amish will offer his sincere presence and guidance to all participants through </em><em><strong>daily morning and evening mentoring sessions</strong></em><em> that help ground you and embody all your growth and learnings from the retreat.</em></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_UN7GdK": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jorge_Luis_Delgado_Our_Guide.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Our Andean Tour Guide",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>For 30 years Jorge Luis’s award winning tour company has been leading people on unique memorable journeys. He is fluent in his native Aymara and Quechua languages as well as Spanish and English and owner of the beautifully located Taypikala Hotels.</p><p>Jorge Luis embodies the wisdom of light of the Inka and Aymara culture which is very profound. In practice this makes the visit to each power place not only have a physical dimension, but transcends, opening the opportunity for people to have a more profound experience of the land and elements. </p><p>Jorge Luis brought to public attention the Aramu Muru Doorway, an inter-dimensional portal located in the Hayu Marca mountains. On the History Channel, he  is featured in more than ten episodes of Ancient Aliens. We are honored to be journeying with a guide who has  this caliber of knowledge. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_6dhgPK": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-06-03_at_9.42.05_AM.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Supporting Guides",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Ahmed Nady</strong></h3><p>Professional Tour Guide to Egypt since 2003. Over 20 year experience in guiding English speakers from different countries around the globe.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_9Ditee": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-06-03_at_9.41.56_AM.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Hanaa Abd Elkhaleq</strong></h3><p>Graduated from the Faculty of Archaeology at Cairo University, specializing in Egyptian Antiquities. Discovered that working in the field of archaeology is not her passion and would not significantly add to her career growth. Consequently, she pursued a diploma in Tourist Guidance from the Faculty of Tourism and Hotels at Helwan University. She has been working as a tour guide since 2003, gaining extensive experience in the field and thoroughly enjoying the journey.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
